timeline
    title SDR milestones, 2005 to 2018
    section SDR 1.0
        2005-2006 : SDR team formed : In production Dec 2006 on TSM tape and METS packages
    section Fedora 3 and Hydra era
        2009 : SDR 2.0 redesign : Fedora-based DOR with Ruby robots and BagIt transfer
        2012 : Argo, dor-services gem, Hydrus and lyber-core repos
        2013 : Moab design published
        2014 : dor-services-app, common-accessioning, purl and pre-assembly repos : Resque robots with robot-master
    section Services era
        2016 : dor_indexing_app and purl-fetcher repos
        2017-2018 : preservation_catalog replaces sdr-preservation-core : Rails workflow server replaces the Java one
